A comment span under a marker-line note leaves no paragraph

```
> - [^n]: {% a
>   %%%
>   z %}
plain

x[^n]
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li></li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>plain</p>
<p>x<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>{% a<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
> - [^n]: a
>   %%%
>   z
plain

x[^n]
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li></li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>plain</p>
<p>x<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>a<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
> :: t
> : [^n]: a
>   %%%
>   z
plain

x[^n]
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
    <dd></dd>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
<p>plain</p>
<p>x<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>a<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
> > - [^n]: a
> >   %%%
> > z
plain

x[^n]
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
    <p>z
plain</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>x<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>a<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```
